  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Best Fish Farmer Competition, Award Event and Roadtrip 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This PSD Toolkit project aims to engage young people who have studied aquaculture but are missing the skills and support to become successful fish farming entrepreneurs in Kenya either as a fish farmer or in the value chain of feed supply, fish distribution, cold chain and public sector. By organising the second edition of the Best Fish Farmer competition and Award Event a group of aspiring young fish farmers is challenged. It will benefit the development of the aquaculture sector by training aspiring fish farmers and linking them to the Aquaculture Academy and other fish farmers to exchange knowledge and experiences. To involve the bordering counties around the Lake Victoria Basin may also support the sector.</narrative>
  </description>
